---
import DemoFrame from './DemoFrame.astro';
import GoProducerConsumerDemo from '../demos/GoProducerConsumerDemo.tsx';
---
<figure class="gpc-figure">
  <DemoFrame title="Producer and consumer: change the channel and the speeds" titleVi="Producer và consumer: đổi channel và tốc độ">
    <GoProducerConsumerDemo client:visible />
  </DemoFrame>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>A teaching model that steps one tick at a time, not a measurement. Pick an unbuffered channel and a fast producer: it spends most ticks blocked, waiting for the consumer.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Mô hình minh họa chạy từng tick, không phải số đo. Chọn channel không buffer và producer nhanh: producer phần lớn thời gian bị chặn, chờ consumer.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
  .gpc-figure { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gpc-figure > .demo-frame { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .gpc-figure > figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
  .gpc .sd-group > span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
  .gpc-stage { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.4fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 10px; align-items: center; margin: 12px 0; }
  @media (max-width: 520px) { .gpc-stage { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .gpc-box { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--bg); font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-body); }
  .gpc-box b { color: var(--text); font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); }
  .gpc-box i { font-style: normal; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gpc-box.is-blocked { border-color: var(--gold); background: var(--gold-tint-bg); }
  .gpc-pipe { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; align-items: stretch; }
  .gpc-pipe small { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; text-align: center; }
  .gpc-slots { display: flex; gap: 4px; padding: 6px; border: 1px dashed var(--border); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--bg-alt); }
  .gpc-slot { flex: 1 1 0; min-height: 34px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; background: var(--bg); font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--text); }
  .gpc-slot.is-full { background: var(--gold-tint-bg); border-color: var(--gold); }
  .gpc-slot.is-wide { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .gpc-slot.is-waiting { color: var(--text); border-color: var(--gold); }
  .gpc-got { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .gpc-got b { color: var(--text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gpc-note { margin: 0 0 12px; padding: 8px 12px; border-left: 3px solid var(--gold); background: var(--bg-alt); font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-body); min-height: 2.6em; }
  .gpc-tick { margin-left: auto; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; align-self: center; }
</style>
